<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Jhabikala Suryabamshi | Portfolio</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <script src="script.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <nav>
            <h2 class="logo">Jhabikala<span>.</span></h2>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#interests">Interests</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <p class="welcome">WELCOME TO MY PORTFOLIO</p>
            <h1>Hello, I'm <span>Jhabikala</span><br>Suryabamshi.</h1>
            <p>
                I love travelling, making new friends,
                exploring technology and learning new skills.
            </p>
            <a href="#about" class="btn">Explore More ↓</a>
            <p id="liveGreeting"></p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="about">
        <h2>About <span>Me</span></h2>
        <p>
            Hello! My name is Jhabikala Suryabamshi.
            I am a curious person who enjoys discovering
            new places, meeting different people and
            learning interesting things.
        </p>
        <p>
            I believe learning never stops, and every
            new experience helps us grow.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="interests" id="interests">
        <h2>My Hobbies & Interests</h2>

        <div class="cards">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="emoji">✈️</div>
                <h3>Travelling</h3>
                <p>Exploring new places and discovering different cultures.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="emoji">🤝</div>
                <h3>Making New Friends</h3>
                <p>Meeting people and creating meaningful connections.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="emoji">💻</div>
                <h3>Technology</h3>
                <p>Exploring technology and discovering digital ideas.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="emoji">📚</div>
                <h3>Learning Skills</h3>
                <p>Learning new things and improving myself every day.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
        <h2>Contact <span>Me</span></h2>
        <p>Have something interesting to share? Let's connect!</p>

        <form id="contactForm">
            <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Your Name" required>
            <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
            <textarea id="message" placeholder="Your Message" required></textarea>
            <button type="submit" class="btn">Send Message ↗</button>
        </form>

        <p id="formStatus"></p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Jhabikala Suryabamshi | Made with ❤️</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
